  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">와....Daum, 편집기;;;; 왜 이렇게 바꼈지 싶네요;;;;; 하하하;; ㅠㅠ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">벌써 변화가 힘들고 그러면 안되는데 말입니다. ^^;;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>간단하게 혼자 self 로 만들어보는</b> </span>순환계입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">완성품은 아래와 같습니다. ㅋ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c1f860ed4940d9382c25570cead229eee596ff5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c1f860ed4940d9382c25570cead229eee596ff5\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"427\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">준비물은<b><u><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"> A4 양면인쇄, 가위</span></u></b>!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7531fcb8b944fa041e79686b4e70cab3d3d57a4e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7531fcb8b944fa041e79686b4e70cab3d3d57a4e\" data-origin-width=\"1027\" data-origin-height=\"723\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1. 심장 벽의 두께를 칠해보고, 심방 심실을 구분해봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48ede7f0a946af67c489015d694f843942284f0c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48ede7f0a946af67c489015d694f843942284f0c\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"495\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">2. 혈관을 모두 4개 자르고, 혈관이름과 두께를 표현해 봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c389b566fe16c689fb587f4fc377a05d6fbd013\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c389b566fe16c689fb587f4fc377a05d6fbd013\" data-origin-width=\"677\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">3. 좌심실에서 시작해 순서대로 혈관을 연결해 봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9626e08b597f32cb520d8b4b7018f58494e65f04\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9626e08b597f32cb520d8b4b7018f58494e65f04\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">4. 판막을 표시해 보구요. (정맥에 칼집을 넣어 판막을 대~충)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/159e925369dec314ffe5271530fe8fc228d76621\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/159e925369dec314ffe5271530fe8fc228d76621\" data-origin-width=\"641\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">5. 온몸과 폐의 모세혈관에서 물질교환도 표시해봅니다. (파일은 조금 수정하였습니다.)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39a88b652c7f8e52a471cfc5abaec332e7e6088d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39a88b652c7f8e52a471cfc5abaec332e7e6088d\" data-origin-width=\"634\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교실에서 전시학습할 때, 모둠 4명을 대~충 묶어 심방, 심실 이름을 주고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교실 출입문과 반대편 귀퉁이 2곳에 폐와 온몸 목걸이를 한 학생을 배치.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">손에 바턴을 줘서 직접 움직여 O2, CO2 교환을 하는 액션을 하면 더 활기찬 교실이 될 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">코로나 단계가 올라갈까 조마조마 하네요. ㅠㅠ 모두 건강하세요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14a1321cd3526bdb9add8d60b43c4c07527d1800?download\" data-file-name=\"종이로 연결해 폐순환 온몸순환 만들기 (A4).hwp\" data-file-size=\"1050112\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1174%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20201116161129&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F14a1321cd3526bdb9add8d60b43c4c07527d1800')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">종이로 연결해 폐순환 온몸순환 만들기 (A4)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.00MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5c1px2njars9jua5i5uh1bi@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv5c1px2njars9jua5i5uh1bi%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33163017443%26signature%3DQWtiuhRkNHbAZZpq0TsErNbz4Gs%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5c1px2njars9jua5i5uh1bi?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NWMxcHgybmphcnM5anVhNWk1dWgxYmkiLCJ0aWQiOiJhOTFhZDMyMS00NjljLTQyYWEtODdjZC1kMTQ5YTg4MjA4NDAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQyOTN9.Tzru41DL51n